      "content": "API for the Apptainer container runtime, enabling programmatic management of HPC container images, instances, and execution for scientific computing workloads. Apptainer (formerly Singularity) is optimized for high-performance computing with support for Docker/OCI containers and HPC schedulers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apptainer Project",
